    "title": "Purcellville vice mayor, town manager arrested by Loudoun County Sheriff's Office - NewsBreak",
    "text": "fox5dc.com\nwebsite\nPurcellville\nPurcellville vice mayor, town manager arrested by Loudoun County Sheriff's Office\nBy Jillian Smith,\n2 hours agoLOUDOUN CO., Va. - The Loudoun County Sheriff's Office says they have arrested the Vice Mayor of Purcellville, Ben Nett, and the Town Manager, Kwasi Fraser. Nett has been charged with six felony counts: four involving violations regarding the Virginia Criminal Information Network and two related to bid rigging and conspiracy.",
